@base = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/demo001
@productId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_ID

### Identity
GET {{base}}/student-info

### Brands list/detail
GET {{base}}/brands

###
GET {{base}}/brands/1

### Product list (summary DTO)
GET {{base}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### Create: change sku if already used; copy returned data.id to productId
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"MANUAL-001","name":"Manual Phone","brand_id":1,"category":"PHONE","price":1200.50,"ram_gb":8,"storage_gb":128,"color":"Black"}

### Detail
GET {{base}}/products/{{productId}}

### Full PUT: unchanged values must still return 200
PUT {{base}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"MANUAL-001","name":"Manual Phone Updated","brand_id":1,"category":"PHONE","price":0,"ram_gb":8,"storage_gb":128,"color":"Black"}

### Delete only the record YOU created: 204, empty body
DELETE {{base}}/products/{{productId}}

### After delete: 404
GET {{base}}/products/{{productId}}

### Invalid pagination: 400
GET {{base}}/products?page=0

### String key
GET {{base}}/tags/NA
